[
  {
    "t0": 0,
    "t1": 1.7778,
    "text": "می‌دونی چرا توی انگلیسی",
    "en": "Do you know why, in English,",
    "scene": 0,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 1.7778,
    "t1": 4.0,
    "text": "یه‌جا A میاریم، یه‌جا THE؟",
    "en": "we sometimes use A, and sometimes THE?",
    "scene": 0,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 4,
    "t1": 7.0,
    "text": "برای جواب، بریم به انگلستانِ هزار سال پیش!",
    "en": "For the answer, let’s visit England a thousand years ago!",
    "scene": 1,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 7,
    "t1": 8.7778,
    "text": "سال ۱۰۶۶، پادشاه انگلستان",
    "en": "In 1066, the king of England",
    "scene": 2,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 8.7778,
    "t1": 11.0,
    "text": "بدون وارث از دنیا می‌ره.",
    "en": "dies without an heir.",
    "scene": 2,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 11,
    "t1": 13.5455,
    "text": "حالا انگلستان به یه پادشاه احتیاج داره:",
    "en": "Now England needs a king:",
    "scene": 3,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 13.5455,
    "t1": 15.0,
    "text": "England needs a king.",
    "en": "England needs a king.",
    "scene": 3,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 15,
    "t1": 16.6364,
    "text": "ولی مشکل اینجاست که سه نفر",
    "en": "But there’s a problem: three men",
    "scene": 4,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 16.6364,
    "t1": 18.0,
    "text": "تاج‌وتخت رو برای خودشون می‌خوان!",
    "en": "each want the throne!",
    "scene": 4,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 18,
    "t1": 21.0,
    "text": "اول هارولد تاج‌گذاری می‌کنه.",
    "en": "First, Harold is crowned.",
    "scene": 5,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 21,
    "t1": 24.0,
    "text": "اما پادشاه نروژ حمله می‌کنه!",
    "en": "But the king of Norway invades!",
    "scene": 6,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 24,
    "t1": 25.3333,
    "text": "هارولد شکستش می‌ده،",
    "en": "Harold defeats him,",
    "scene": 7,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 25.3333,
    "t1": 28.0,
    "text": "ولی هنوز نفس راحت نکشیده که",
    "en": "but before he can catch his breath,",
    "scene": 7,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 28,
    "t1": 32.0,
    "text": "ویلیام با یه لشکر دیگه از راه می‌رسه!",
    "en": "William arrives with another army!",
    "scene": 8,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 32,
    "t1": 33.875,
    "text": "این بار هارولد کشته می‌شه",
    "en": "This time, Harold is killed",
    "scene": 9,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 33.875,
    "t1": 35.0,
    "text": "و ویلیام می‌شه:",
    "en": "and William becomes:",
    "scene": 9,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 35,
    "t1": 39.0,
    "text": "The king of England!",
    "en": "The king of England!",
    "scene": 10,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 39,
    "t1": 40.5,
    "text": "حالا دقت کردی؟ اول گفتیم A KING؛",
    "en": "Notice? First we said A KING:",
    "scene": 11,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 40.5,
    "t1": 42.0,
    "text": "یعنی یه پادشاه، هنوز مشخص نکردیم کدوم.",
    "en": "a king—we haven’t specified which one.",
    "scene": 11,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 42,
    "t1": 45.0,
    "text": "ولی THE KING یعنی اون پادشاه مشخص!",
    "en": "But THE KING means that particular king!",
    "scene": 12,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 45,
    "t1": 46.3333,
    "text": "و جالبه که ریشهٔ این تفاوت",
    "en": "Interestingly, the roots of this distinction",
    "scene": 13,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 46.3333,
    "t1": 47.2222,
    "text": "به انگلیسی قدیم برمی‌گرده!",
    "en": "go back to Old English!",
    "scene": 13,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 47.2222,
    "t1": 49.0,
    "text": "A از کلمهٔ ĀN به معنی «یک» اومده.",
    "en": "A comes from ĀN, meaning “one.”",
    "scene": 13,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 49,
    "t1": 51.6923,
    "text": "اما THE از خانوادهٔ کلمهٔ اشارهٔ that؛",
    "en": "THE belongs to the demonstrative family, like “that”:",
    "scene": 14,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 51.6923,
    "t1": 54.0,
    "text": "چیزی شبیه «اون» و «همون» خودمون!",
    "en": "something like “that one” or “the very one.”",
    "scene": 14,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 54,
    "t1": 55.5,
    "text": "پس فرق اصلی چیه؟",
    "en": "So what’s the key difference?",
    "scene": 15,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 55.5,
    "t1": 58.875,
    "text": "وقتی شنونده می‌تونه بفهمه دقیقاً کدوم چیز رو می‌گی،",
    "en": "When your listener can identify exactly which thing you mean,",
    "scene": 15,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 58.875,
    "t1": 60.0,
    "text": "معمولاً THE میاریم؛",
    "en": "we usually use THE;",
    "scene": 15,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 60,
    "t1": 64.0,
    "text": "حتی اگه قبلاً اسمش رو نشنیده باشه!",
    "en": "even if it hasn’t been mentioned before!",
    "scene": 16,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 64,
    "t1": 65.5385,
    "text": "برای تمرین این تفاوت،",
    "en": "To practise this distinction,",
    "scene": 17,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 65.5385,
    "t1": 69.0,
    "text": "یه چالش تصویری و یه ورک‌شیت کاربردی آماده کردیم.",
    "en": "we’ve prepared a visual challenge and a practical worksheet.",
    "scene": 17,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 69,
    "t1": 71.34,
    "text": "فقط THE رو کامنت کن",
    "en": "Just comment THE",
    "scene": 18,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  },
  {
    "t0": 71.34,
    "t1": 72.744,
    "text": "تا برات بفرستیم!",
    "en": "and we’ll send them to you!",
    "scene": 18,
    "timing": "estimated_unverified"
  }
]